                        


Item # :  SCP-5127

Object Class:  Safe

Special Containment Procedures : SCP-5127 is to be contained in a dry and cool place. SCP-5127 is only allowed to be accessed by personnel with level 3 security clearance or higher.

Description:  SCP-5127 is a 120 ml Povidone-iodine wound solution, when applied to a wound, it effectively cures the subjects wound within 4 hours, exact time depending on the severity of the wound. all attempts to replicate the active ingredients of SCP-5127 have been unsuccessful.

Request 5127-1:  Agent ██████████ has requested to apply one (1) drop of SCP-5127 to apply to his scar wound. Request denied.

Request 5127-2:  Dr. ██████████ ████████ has requested to apply two (2) drops of SCP-5127 for testing D-5127-2 with a wound on his legs with approximately five (5) inch in height and two (2) inch wide. Request has been approved.

Request 5127-3:  Dr. ██████ ██████ has requested 35 drops to transfer in her container for her own wounds. Request denied.

Request 5127-4:  Dr.████████ ██████ has requested 13 drops for testing on SCP-682's wounds. Request has been approved.

                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    

                    
                    
                        
